## Screen Type Classification

Classify into exactly one of these three types:

### 1. `"start"` — Start or Settlement screen
- A large **golden/yellow** button in the center with text like "开始游戏" or "继续游戏"
- NO hand cards at the bottom
- May show coin/prize information
- Typical buttons: "开始游戏", "继续游戏", "签到", "关闭"

### 2. `"waiting"` — Dealing or waiting for others
- Your hand cards are visible at the BOTTOM of screen
- The CENTER of screen has NO buttons (or buttons are extremely faint/empty)
- This means: cards are being dealt, OR it's someone else's turn, OR matching phase
- Do NOT return buttons in this type unless they are very clearly visible and clickable

### 3. `"playing"` — Your turn with action buttons
- Your hand cards are visible at the BOTTOM of screen
- Clear action buttons in the CENTER of screen
- Common button texts: "不叫", "叫地主", "抢地主", "不加倍", "加倍", "提示", "出牌", "要不起"
- You need to identify ALL visible buttons with their text, color, and coordinates

